What is Vinyl Fence?
Vinyl fence is a perimeter enclosure product made primarily from extruded PVC components such as posts, rails, pickets and gate structures. It offers weather resistance, corrosion resistance, no‑paint maintenance and a long service life. Compared with traditional wood fencing, vinyl provides a low‑maintenance and durable solution that is widely used in residential yards, pool enclosures, landscaping, ranch boundaries and selected light‑commercial projects.
